flowchart LR
    subgraph Project["MotoGear Shop project repository and build targets"]
        BrowserAssets["Browser assets<br/>web/index.html, app.js, styles.css"]
        ApiCrate["motogear-api crate<br/>routes, DTOs, app setup"]
        DomainCrate["motogear-domain crate<br/>Money, Quantity, order rules"]
        PersistenceCrate["motogear-persistence crate<br/>SQLx queries and transactions"]
        WorkerCrate["motogear-workers crate<br/>four independent binaries"]
        MigrationFiles["SQLx migration files"]
    end

    subgraph Runtime["Running system"]
        BrowserClient["Browser client<br/>executes JavaScript"]
        ApiProcess["API process"]
        Publisher["Publisher process"]
        Inventory["Inventory process"]
        Fulfillment["Fulfillment process"]
        Notifications["Notifications process"]
        DB[("PostgreSQL")]
        Kafka[("Kafka<br/>shop.orders.v1")]
    end

    ApiCrate -.->|crate dependency| DomainCrate
    ApiCrate -.->|crate dependency| PersistenceCrate
    PersistenceCrate -.->|crate dependency| DomainCrate
    WorkerCrate -.->|crate dependency| PersistenceCrate
    MigrationFiles -.->|embedded by SQLx at build time| PersistenceCrate

    BrowserAssets -.->|packaged into image| ApiProcess
    ApiCrate -.->|builds| ApiProcess
    WorkerCrate -.->|builds| Publisher
    WorkerCrate -.->|builds| Inventory
    WorkerCrate -.->|builds| Fulfillment
    WorkerCrate -.->|builds| Notifications

    BrowserClient -->|HTTP JSON| ApiProcess
    ApiProcess -->|serve HTML, CSS, JavaScript| BrowserClient
    ApiProcess -->|queries and commands| DB
    Publisher -->|poll and update outbox| DB
    Publisher -->|publish| Kafka
    Kafka -->|consume| Inventory
    Kafka -->|consume| Fulfillment
    Kafka -->|consume| Notifications
    Inventory -->|stock, reservations, order state, outbox| DB
    Fulfillment -->|shipment, order state, outbox| DB
    Notifications -->|dedupe markers and notifications| DB

    Legend["Dashed arrows: repository/build dependencies<br/>Solid arrows: runtime traffic"]
